t-driven approach, the nation’s frustration with the status quo handed them the keys to Number 10, beginning an era that would redefine the country's identity. Identify the *year* and the *leader* who became Britain's first Prime Minister of a certain “kind”.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:42:29Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Thatcher", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:42:33Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "1978", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:42:36Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Uk", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:42:37Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Labour isn't working ‎", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:42:38Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:42:43Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "First woman", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:42:44Z", "username": "Yash Badani", "text": "1979", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:42:47Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Woman PM", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:42:58Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "1979 and Margaret Thatcher is correct", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-10T13:43:15Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Arey yaar prso hi pucha tha 🙈\nBut year bhool gya 😂", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"time